<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mixed in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 600.79, up 2.35.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.06.</p>
<p>Declines beat advances 264 to 253.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 18,053,700 compared with 17,787,090 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1881))</p>
</text>
